<view class="merchant-page page-shell merchant-subpage merchant-service-edit-page">
  <view class="merchant-header merchant-subpage-header">
    <button class="merchant-back-button" bindtap="goBack">返回</button>
    <view class="merchant-title">配置服务</view>
    <view class="merchant-subtitle">绑定平台服务并设置商家展示价格，服务创建仍走原有 service</view>
  </view>

  <view class="merchant-section-card merchant-boundary-card">
    <view class="merchant-section-title">服务调用边界</view>
    <view class="merchant-section-note">
      本页只维护商家服务展示字段，不新增自动审核、真实库存或智能定价；价格字段单位：分。
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="merchant-section-card merchant-form-card">
    <view class="merchant-section-head">
      <view class="merchant-section-title">服务信息</view>
      <view class="merchant-section-note">保存后返回上一页</view>
    </view>
    <view class="merchant-form-item">
      <text class="merchant-form-label form-label">平台服务 ID</text>
      <input
        class="merchant-form-input form-input service-input"
        placeholder="输入平台服务 ID"
        value="{{form.serviceId}}"
        bindinput="onInput"
        data-field="serviceId"
      />
    </view>
    <view class="merchant-form-item">
      <text class="merchant-form-label form-label">价格</text>
      <input
        class="merchant-form-input form-input service-input"
        placeholder="单位：分，例如 9900"
        type="number"
        value="{{form.price}}"
        bindinput="onInput"
        data-field="price"
      />
      <view class="merchant-field-note">只格式化展示提示，不改变金额单位。</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{ errorText }}" class="merchant-error">{{ errorText }}</view>
  <view class="merchant-empty merchant-form-hint">服务名称、分类、描述、上门说明和状态仍以后续接口返回或原有页面能力为准。</view>

  <view class="merchant-sticky-actions">
    <button
      class="merchant-action-button merchant-submit-button"
      loading="{{submitting}}"
      disabled="{{submitting}}"
      bindtap="submit"
    >
      {{ submitting ? '保存中' : '保存服务' }}
    </button>
  </view>
</view>
